 "summary": [
  "(a) Depth 5\u219225 mm: p2p falls 7.94\u21920.056 A0 (142\u00d7, p2p \u221d d^-3.14, r\u00b2 1.00), the negative lobe widens 2.2\u21928.5 ms (FWHM) and the end-of-fibre share grows 3\u219224 %; the lobe minimum sits at (\u0394z+\u03b4)/v = 6.1 ms for the shallow fibres and drifts to 3.2 ms at 25 mm as the broad far-field lobe merges with the generation deflection, and the EOF peak from 15.1 ms near the surface (L/v = 15; 5 %-onset 12.5\u201313.7 ms, inside the one-sided window's taper 0.75\u20131 L/v) to 21.7 ms at depth.",
  "(b) Electrode 0\u219260\u00b0 round the cylinder (0\u219242 mm on the skin, fibre 10 mm deep): p2p falls to 0.090 A0 (half amplitude at \u03b8 \u2248 20\u00b0, 14 mm arc), the lobe FWHM 4.2\u21928.3 ms, EOF share 14\u219226 %; the wave's arrival is unchanged (lobe minimum 6.1 ms up to 30\u00b0, drifting to 4.2 ms at 60\u00b0 as the far-field lobe broadens; EOF peak 15.6\u201319.8 ms).",
  "(c) Distal tendon L2 = 20\u219280 mm (junction fixed 20 mm from the electrode): the lobe stays at 6.1\u20136.1 ms and the EOF peak walks 6.4\u219220.3 ms against L2/v = 5\u219220 ms (peak \u2212 L2/v within 2.7 ms; 5 %-onsets 4.6\u219216.4 ms); p2p 0.63\u20131.00 A0, lowest with the tendon under the electrode.",
  "(d) Velocity 2\u21926 m/s (dz = v/fs kept): the lobe arrives at (\u0394z + 4.5 mm)/v = 12.2\u21924.2 ms, the EOF peak at 31.3\u219210.3 ms (L/v = 30\u219210), the 10 %-duration stretches as 1/v (27.3\u21929.0 ms; duration\u00b7v = 54\u201355 mm) and MNF \u221d v (39\u2192115 Hz); p2p 0.99\u20131.00 A0.",
  "(e) Fat 1\u219218 mm (fibre 5 mm inside the muscle, so 8\u219225 mm below the skin): p2p 1.93\u21920.12 A0 (16\u00d7) and MNF 90\u219243 Hz, lobe FWHM 3.4\u21928.1 ms; timing unchanged (lobe 5.6\u20136.1 ms, EOF peak 15.4\u201318.3 ms). At equal depth below the skin the same fibre under the default 3-mm fat gives 0.056 A0 at 25 mm (fat spreads the potential, muscle shunts it).",
  "(f) FCU pool, real anatomy: MUs 57, 52, 54, 60, 62, 58, 59 (74\u2013102 fibres) at d = 5.1\u219212.5 mm from the centre electrode: p2p 54\u219217 \u00b5V (p2p \u221d d^-1.0, r\u00b2 0.84; per fibre d^-1.2), lobe FWHM 3.4\u21924.4 ms, 10 %-duration 17.6\u219222.0 ms, MNF 87\u219270 Hz; the lobe at 11.0\u201312.5 ms is the common 41-mm IZ\u2013electrode distance at 4 m/s (10.3 ms) plus a lag that grows with d."
